<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>HotNews — 中國，每一天。</title><description>Daily stories about China in technology, finance, sports, entertainment, lifestyle, science, travel and culture — for readers around the world.</description><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/</link><language>zh-TW</language><item><title>中國手機巨頭 Infinix 推出全球首款遊戲控制器與散熱底座</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-chinese-phone-giant-infinix-unveils-world-first/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-chinese-phone-giant-infinix-unveils-world-first/</guid><description>Infinix 是總部位於深圳的傳音旗下專攻遊戲的品牌，現推出兩款 GT NX 配件：一款搭載全球首創像素級精準觸控板、適合射擊遊戲的控制器，以及一款內建熱電致冷技術的底座。此次發布顯示中國低調的手機巨頭正積極進軍高利潤的行動遊戲周邊設備市場。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>games</category><category>innovation</category><category>manufacturing</category></item><item><title>AI 主導精密投資詐騙</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-ai-takes-over-sophisticated-investment-scams/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-ai-takes-over-sophisticated-investment-scams/</guid><description>中國投資者面臨新一波 AI 驅動的金融詐騙，因人工智慧能實現更精密的「養豬騙局」，誘騙受害者轉帳大筆資金。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>economy</category><category>finance</category><category>daily-life</category></item><item><title>中國音響設備在東南亞大放異彩</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-audio-gear-makes-big-noise/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-audio-gear-makes-big-noise/</guid><description>從深圳的小店到東南亞每月50萬銷量，中國音響品牌正透過調整產品以滿足當地消費者需求，在海外蓬勃發展。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>exports</category><category>technology</category><category>innovation</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>daily-life</category></item><item><title>中國汽車業迎來新轉型</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-auto-industry-faces-new-turn/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-auto-industry-faces-new-turn/</guid><description>四個信號表明，在中國汽車業，市場力量正在重塑競爭格局，行業即將進入新的整合階段。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>exports</category><category>innovation</category><category>economy</category></item><item><title>中國鋰電池繁榮面臨石墨挑戰</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-lithium-battery-boom-faces-graphite/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-lithium-battery-boom-faces-graphite/</guid><description>中國鋰電池產業宣布擴建74萬噸，同時擔憂石墨供應瓶頸可能影響電動車生產。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>innovation</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>technology</category><category>economy</category></item><item><title>鋰電池市場：現實與炒作的碰撞</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-lithium-battery-market-reality-meets-hype/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-lithium-battery-market-reality-meets-hype/</guid><description>儘管市場擔憂供過於求，鋰電池仍然供不應求。隨著需求持續增長，兩個關鍵的供應因素被低估了。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>innovation</category><category>economy</category><category>technology</category></item><item><title>中國智慧手機巨頭轉換晶片供應商</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-smartphone-giants-switch-chip-suppliers/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-smartphone-giants-switch-chip-suppliers/</guid><description>中國主要手機製造商OPPO和vivo出人意料地轉向使用MediaTek晶片旗艦型號，標示著在激烈競爭中產業的轉變。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><categ